  "description": "HTTP tests against your own ASP.NET Core API with XUnitAssured.Http: ApiFixture hosts the API in memory with WebApplicationFactory and hands out a shared client, a new client per identity, clients with and without cookies, the API's services and its logs — one instance for the whole suite through a collection fixture.",
